/T (Based on the forty-five respondents from Life Institute Mariveles, the findings indicate that the majority of the students are aware of the implementation of DepEd Order No. 15, s. 2026. Most respondents believe that the new grading system accurately reflects their academic performance and understand how their grades are computed under the revised grading system. In addition, most students reported that the revised transmutation system motivates them to perform better academically and encourages them to pay closer attention during classroom discussions.)
