<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/P 283 0 R
/T (Based on the forty respondents from Mariveles, Bataan. The findings indicate that the majority of the participants use 1xBet at least once a week and spend money on the platform every month, suggesting that regular gambling activity is common among the respondents. Most participants also reported spending more than one hour per gambling session and believed that spending more time on the platform leads to higher gambling expenditures. Furthermore, a majority admitted that they had exceeded their planned gambling budget after staying longer on 1xBet.)
/E (Based on the forty respondents from Mariveles, Bataan. The findings indicate that the majority of the participants use 1xBet at least once a week and spend money on the platform every month, suggesting that regular gambling activity is common among the respondents. Most participants also reported spending more than one hour per gambling session and believed that spending more time on the platform leads to higher gambling expenditures. Furthermore, a majority admitted that they had exceeded their planned gambling budget after staying longer on 1xBet.)
/Pg 29 0 R
/K [7]
>>
