/T (Furthermore, the majority believe that the frequency of sending remittances affects their financial planning behavior and reported having long-term financial plans, such as savings, business investments, or retirement funds. In addition, most respondents acknowledged that unexpected family expenses influence their financial planning, while an overwhelming majority agreed that regular remittances contribute to their family's financial stability. )
