/Title (Based on the forty Overseas Filipino Worker \(OFW\) respondents, the findings indicate that the majority send remittances regularly, demonstrating that consistent remittance is a common practice among the participants. Most respondents also prepare a budget before sending remittances, save a portion of their income beforehand, and keep records of their monthly income and expenses, reflecting responsible financial planning and management.)
