/Title (The main goal of this study is to determine the impact of DepEd Order No. 15, s. 2026 on the academic achievement of high school students at Life Institute Mariveles. Specifically, the study seeks to examine whether the implementation of the revised classroom assessment and grading system has improved, worsened, or made no significant difference in students' academic performance. It also aims to assess how the changes in grading, classroom assessment, and grade transmutation influence students' learning outcomes and overall academic achievement.)
