/Title (Remittances play a significant role in shaping the economic outlook and financial expectations of Filipino households. Using data from the Bangko Sentral ng Pilipinas \(BSP\) Consumer Expectations Survey, the study found that households receiving regular remittances tend to have greater financial confidence and are better able to plan for future expenses, savings, and investments. The findings suggest that consistent remittance inflows contribute to improved financial stability and encourage households to make more informed long-term financial decisions.)
