/Title (The main goal of this study is to determine whether there is a significant relationship between the amount of time adult users in Mariveles spend on the 1xBet platform and their monthly gambling expenditures. Specifically, the study aims to examine whether spending more time using the platform is associated with higher or lower monthly gambling expenses. The findings of the study are expected to provide a better understanding of the gambling behaviors of adult users and may serve as a basis for future research, awareness programs, or policy discussions related to responsible gambling.)
/Dest [21 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 1668 0 R
/Prev 1683 0 R
>>
